{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13247","headline":"题高云客舍 · 皇甫冉","name":"题高云客舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤兴日自深，浮云非所仰。\n窗中西城峻，树外东川广。\n晏起簪葛巾，闲吟倚藜杖。\n阮公道在醉，庄子生常养。\n五柳转扶疎，千峰恣来往。\n清秋香秔获，白露寒菜长。\n吴国滞风烟，平陵延梦想。\n时人趋缨弁，高鸟违罗网。\n世事徒乱纷，吾心方浩荡。\n唯将山与水，处处谐真赏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}